INSERT IGNORE INTO `quest_offer_reward` (`ID`,`Emote1`,`Emote2`,`Emote3`,`Emote4`,`EmoteDelay1`,`EmoteDelay2`,`EmoteDelay3`,`EmoteDelay4`,`RewardText`,`VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
(7,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well done, citizen.  Those kobolds are thieves and cowards, but in large numbers they pose a threat to us.  And the humans of Stormwind do not need another threat.$B$BFor defeating them, you have my gratitude.',70124),
(8,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Oh? A letter? Wonderful news! I\'ve been waiting on word from my dear old mother in Deathknell. Such a saint, she is. I wonder how she\'s holding up.$B$BWhat? Too cheery? Not buying it, are you?$B$BWell, get lost then... it\'s really no business who the letter\'s from anyway. Go on! Get lost!$B$BCome back when you\'ve got some coin to spend... loafer.$B$BNext thing you know, you\'ll be coming back to rest after a long days adventure or some stupid thing like that.',70124),
(15,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I don\'t like hearing of all these kobolds in our mine.  No good can come of this.  Here, take this as payment, and when you\'re ready, speak to me again.  I would like you to go back to the mines one more time...',70124),
(18,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Back with some bandanas, I see.  The Stormwind Army appreciates your help.',70124),
(21,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Once again, you have earned my respect, and the gratitude of the Stormwind Army.  There may yet be kobolds in the mine, but I will marshal others against them.  We have further tasks for you.',70124),
(33,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You\'ve been busy!  I can\'t wait to cook up that wolf meat...$B$BI have some things here you might want - take your pick!',70124),
(54,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well, it says here that you\'ve been awarded Acting Deputy Status with the Stormwind Marshals.  Congratulations.$B$BAnd good luck - keeping Elwynn safe is no picnic... what with most the army busy doing who knows what for who knows which noble!$B$BIt\'s hard to keep track of politics in these dark days...',70124),
(170,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'If the problems we\'ve had here are indicative of what is happening elsewhere in our lands, by Magni\'s beard, we have some troubles ahead of us! I can only hope that the king and Senate are taking steps to deal with the threat the troggs pose.',70124),
(179,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ah! Wonderful. The wolf meat should do nicely. Oh, don\'t worry, $n, I wouldn\'t forget my part of the bargain. Here, one of these should fit you.',70124),
(182,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Argh! Those Light-blasted trolls!$b$b<He takes a few breaths and seems to settle down... a bit.>$b$bA group of them came in the night and stole my journal! I knew better than to trust that good-for-nothing appr...',70124),
(183,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Excellent! I can go back to my... leisurely... hunting now. Thank you, $n.',70124),
(218,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Wonderful, $n! Many thanks for retrieving my notebook. Well, it would seem that the troll situation here in Coldridge Valley is under control and not much cause for worry.$b$bAfter I put the finishing touches on my report, I\'ll need someone to courier it to my brother Senir.',70124),
(233,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ahh, excellent. It\'s been a while since I received word from Ironforge. Ach, these letters from me mum warm my heart. Here, not fair you don\'t get some readin\', too. Take one of these manuals we have lyin\' around.',70124),
(282,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'What\'s this? Ah, my brother\'s report. Hmm...$b$bI told him to be sparing with the use of the King\'s name, but he didn\'t listen. No harm, I suppose, though it\'s sure to ruffle some feathers in the Senate. Not that those weren\'t some feathers that needed ruffling! Hah!$b$bNonetheless, I guess that means that I should send my report on to Ironforge as well, but I must admit I\'m a bit behind. Bloody cold.$b$bI should have some work for you later, if you\'re interested.',70124),
(354,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Revenge has a sweet taste, don\'t you think?  When you destroyed the Agamands, did you catch any hint of free will within them?  I hope so.  I hope they knew fear before they were smashed into oblivion.$B$BIt is a foolish hope, I know.  But it is a hope I foster nonetheless.',70124),
(355,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Coleman speaks well of you, $n, telling of your successful forays into the Agamand Mills.$B$BThe Forsaken have need of your talents once again...',70124),
(356,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Very good. Your efforts do much to keep the Scourge at bay. A commendation will be sent to my superior, Executor Zygand.',70124),
(358,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Expertly done, $n.  The Scourge are mistaken if they think they can use those corpses against us, and the fluid you gathered from the Rot Hide slaves will be studied by our Apothecaries.  It may have secrets we can use against them.$B$BAs I said, well done.  But our struggle continues, and the conflict will surely offer you more chances to prove your worth to the Forsaken.',70124),
(359,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Magistrate Sevren wants a report?  Very well: the defenders at The Bulwark are holding the majority of the Scourge at bay, but some do slip through on occasion.$B$BWe have seen sporadic Scourge activity east of this station, with a concentration around the Balnir Farmstead.',70124),
(360,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It is troubling to hear of the Scourge slipping past the Bulwark.  The Lich King and his minions are ceaseless in their assaults.$B$BBut we will not give in.  He will not take us again!',70124),
(362,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you.  Devlin\'s bones will rest nicely on my mantle.$B$BIf my cold heart can find warmth, it is in knowing that the Agamands are destroyed.  They failed me and my family when the Plague came - now I swear I will smash their remains under my heel!',70124),
(363,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Another of the walking dead, hm? Must have been quite a shock, waking up in the crypt with only the cold and Mordo to greet you...$b$bI see the confusion on your face. Let me try to explain our... situation... to you.$b$bWe have been freed from the control of the Lich King by our new leader, Lady Sylvanas. The Dark Lady guides us in our war against the hated Scourge and the holdouts of humanity who dog our every step.',70124),
(364,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It is unfortunate that the Scourge cannot be brought into the fold, their large numbers would be useful in the battles ahead.$b$bBut they will not join us, so we have no choice but to destroy them.',70124),
(374,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Varimathras would be proud.  You serve your leaders well, $c.',70124),
(375,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I appreciate your efforts, $n.  May Sylvanas recognize your bravery one day. . . .',70124),
(376,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you, $n. This armor should help you out.$b$bHopefully, it should do you more good than the last one to wear it...',70124),
(380,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Hmm, well, it\'s a start. It\'ll take a few weeks or months to fully clean out the infestation. After that, we\'ll have to get down there with some torches to burn away the webbing.$b$bYou\'ve done your duty well, $n, I\'m sure I can find something else for you to do.',70124),
(381,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'If only they listened to reason, eh, $n? Perhaps we could sit them down for reasonable discourse... ha!$b$bLight-blinded fools.',70124),
(382,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Hmm... Let\'s see what you\'ve got...$b$b<He begins to rifle through the documents you recovered.>$b$bSome news of their exploits against us... Worthless. Scouting reports... New orders, "Continue to build up a camp near the ruined city..." Nothing we didn\'t know already... Ah, what\'s this? A map of the dispositions of some of their field commanders and agents! We can use this.',70124),
(383,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Yes, this is very good. You\'ve done well in obtaining this information, $n. Hmm... names of the officers in the Tirisfal Glades...$b$bImagine the blow we could deal to the morale of those bloody zealots if we were to kill their leaders in one swift strike.',70124),
(398,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Maggot Eye\'s dastardly acts have finally been avenged.  Maybe your acts of valor will send a clear message to those who wish to bring harm to our people.  On behalf of the town of Brill I thank you, $n.',70124),
(404,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well done.  I regret not being there to see you smash those undead into rotting pulp!',70124),
(407,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'By the Light!  Finally some food!  Sweet, sweet pumpkin. . . .',70124),
(426,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Your efforts in the war are felt among us, $n.  I will not thank you for doing what is necessary, but the Deathguards of Tirisfal will remember your name.',70124),
(427,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Captain Vachon\'s death will slow down the Scarlet Crusade\'s advancement in Tirisfal quite a bit.  But other threats loom.',70124),
(492,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The scales are perfect, $n. Exactly what I needed for this concoction.',70124),
(747,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The tauren of Narache thank you, $n. You show much promise.',70124),
(783,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ah, good.  Another volunteer.  We\'re getting a lot of you these days.$B$BI hope it\'s enough.$B$BThe human lands are threatened from without, and so many of our forces have been marshaled abroad.  This, in turn, leaves room for corrupt and lawless groups to thrive within our borders.$B$BIt is a many-fronted battle we wage, $n.  Gird yourself for a long campaign.',70124),
(840,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Oh, so Takrin sent you? He\'s an excellent scout, I\'m not sure what I\'d do without him.$B$BI\'ll sign your recruitment letter, but what we really need is someone at the Crossroads.',70124),
(842,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Alright, $n. You want to earn your keep with the Horde? Well there\'s plenty to do here, so listen close and do what you\'re told.$b$b $gI see that look in your eyes, do not think I will tolerate any insolence. Thrall himself has declared the Hordes females to be on equal footing with you men. Disrespect me in the slightest, and you will know true pain. : I\'m happy to have met you. Thrall will be glad to know that more females like you and I are taking the initiative to push forward in the Barrens.;',70124),
(886,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'My brethren in Thunder Bluff were wise to send you, young $c.  For the mystery of the Barrens is one that I alone cannot unravel.$B$BWith your aid, let us hope we can find answers to our questions.',70124),
(1492,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'A small enough crate. Yes, I should be able to find room for this aboard the ship. It sails with the next tide, I trust this is soon enough? Excellent. Let me just enter it into my ledger.$b$bAll taken care of! Good day to you, $c.',70124),
(1885,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Hm. No doubt you made your way here at first mention of my summons, yes? Of course. I would expect no less from a prospective Deathstalker.',70124),
(2158,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Rest and relaxation for the tired and cold -- that\'s our motto! Please, take a seat by the fire and rest your weary bones.$B$BWould you like to try a sampling of some of our fine food and drink?',70124),
(2160,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ah, at last, the supplies from Hands! I was beginning to worry, we\'ve had scarce word from Anvilmar ever since the troggs overran the pass.$b$bThanks for bringing this to me, $n. And please, make yourself comfortable. You must be tired after your journey.',70124),
(3092,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'And it is my job to make sure you are prepared by teaching you the basics of our profession--how to tame your pet, how to fire your rifle, and many other skills that will become necessary.$B$BHunters are a strong part of our tradition and history, $n. You would do well to remember how important you are to the tribe. You will be respected and revered if you serve our people well.',70124),
(3100,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Get yourself squared away, learn the layout of the land, and come back to me whenever you need training. I\'ll be here night or day.$B$BThe Knights of the Silver Hand have done well in making this place fairly safe, but as you meet the other citizens, I think you\'ll find they all have problems they could use some help with--help a warrior can give them. Good luck.',70124),
(3361,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Huzzah, you\'ve found them!  You\'re an absolute savior, my friend.  Here, it\'s not much, but it\'s something for the trouble I\'ve put you through!  Thank you!',70124),
(3364,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ah good, now this will hit the spot.  Allow me to take a small break while I enjoy this scalding mornbrew!',70124),
(3365,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Excellent, $n!  You\'d be surprised how many couriers I meet who forget to do something as simple as bring back the mug.  Mugs don\'t grow on trees, or so they tell me!$B$BHere\'s a little something for the effort.  Thanks again for your help.',70124),
(3901,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I am finished with you, $n - you have shown yourself to be worthy of the freedom that you have been given.  Many will stand against you for what you have become, but know that no matter what they may try to do against us, we are free and will not be shackled again.$B$BTake these and be on your way.  You have much to accomplish, $c.',70124),
(3902,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Great work $n, I knew you weren\'t useless.  Here - have one of the better items I\'ve found out of the lots that have been collected so far.',70124),
(3903,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Oh, Deputy Willem told you to speak with me?  He\'s a brave man and always willing to help, but his duties keep him stuck at Northshire Abbey and I\'m afraid the problem I have today is beyond him.$B$BPerhaps you can help me?',70124),
(5261,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'That\'s true.  I\'m looking for someone to hunt me some wolves!  Are you that person?',70124),
(5481,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'What\'s this? Gloom weed?! I\'ve no need for gloom weed! That mindless mass of flesh is out there picking daisies and convincing the Lady knows how many dupes like you into doing the same. No offense.$b$bVery well, you\'re here now and that\'s all that matters. Since I\'m not going to bother to try to explain things to that abomination how about you collect what I really need... doom weed!',70124),
(5722,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The body looks seriously beaten by clubs or fists, but most of the corpse\'s clothing and equipment still looks present. It seems the troggs do not overly care much for material wealth.$B$BYou begin to search the body for anything of interest that might help Magatha.',70124),
(5761,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ha! You\'ve done it! Thrall will be so pleased.$B$BI will ensure this heart is taken care of properly.$B$BFor now though, you must celebrate your victory. I will inform Thrall of your success.$B$BThank you for your aid, $c.',70124),
(6126,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Greetings young druid, I\'m glad to see you ready and eager to learn about the curing of poisons.$B$BWhile most druids in the past were put through pre-planned trials, your work will involve no such thing.  There has been a rash of animal poisonings at the Crossroads in the Barrens, and they\'re unable to bring it under control.  Someone there has requested Moonglade for aid, so we are sending you there to aid them.  This is no exercise - the work you\'ll do is quite real.  Bear this in mind.',70124),
(6395,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You have done a good deed today, $n.  Although our struggle against the Scourge continues, let us hope that Marla and Samuel will find peace together in their final resting place. As a token of my gratitude, please take one of these manuals I found.',70124),
(79097,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you, $n. Our knowledge expands through your efforts.\r\n\r\nIf you discover more magical works that might benefit the library, please bring them to me.',70124),
(86784,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Extra firewood? That is always welcome. It will keep these old bones warm through the cold nights of the Glades.\r\n\r\nI have a sling for collecting wood myself, so you might as well hang onto that basket.',70124),
(90902,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Pain is nothing new to those who have endured death, and as such the Forsaken are particularly hardy to it. Pain has a purifying property as well that you should embrace as a badge of honor and evidence that you are, in fact, still a servant of the light despite your new circumstances. \r\n\r\nBe well and walk in the light once more, paladin.',70124),
(91208,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Tragically, more than a few of our brothers and sisters succumb to a similar madness after being risen. As precious as every Forsaken soul is, sometimes the best we can do is grant those that cannot acclimate a clean end.\r\n\r\nI will say a prayer to the light for her. Thank you for doing what must be done, $n.',70124),
(91209,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Welcome aboard, $c. It\'s always encouraging to see more of our number roaming these lands. There are many here in Brill in need of assistance from adventurers such as yourself. Seek employment and grow stronger in the light. Return to me whenever you need training. \r\n\r\nWhen you\'ve proven yourself to myself and the people of Brill, I will provide guidance for the next leg of your journey.\r\n\r\nGo with the light, $c.',70124),
(91282,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Another fresh recruit? Welcome to Tyr\'s Watch, $ubrother:sister;.',70124),
(91285,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'We appreciate the assistance. I\'m sure this won\'t stop the attacks entirely, but it\'ll hopefully slow them down a bit. It\'s hard enough rebuilding this place without a murloc trying to stab you in the back with a spear.',70124),
(91294,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Breton sent you up here, eh? Excellent.\r\n\r\nMy name is Danitha Morr, and I am the closest thing this keep has to a commander. If you come seeking fellowship amongst those that still remain loyal to the light, you\'ve come to the right place.\r\n\r\nThere\'s a lot of work to do here before we can fully establish ourselves, and we\'d be most appreciative if you would be willing to lend aid.',70124),
(91741,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Hey! How did you end up with that? It\'s supposed to be on the shelf! Oh dear, the kobolds have been stealing my books again. They must want to eat them!\r\n\r\nThanks for bringing back the book, but what will I do about the rest of my missing collection?',70124),
(91743,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you so much! Here! Take one of these how-to books. I don\'t need them.\r\n\r\nBut there are still so many books missing. The kobolds don\'t seem to be eating them. So, why do they want them?',70124),
(91745,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Kobolds with books? Yah, I\'ve seen kobolds running back and forth with books, yelling at each other. They must be stealing them from the library inside the abbey.',70124),
(91752,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you for returning these stolen books, $n. I\'ll get them back to Brother Paxton at once.\r\n\r\nYou\'re becoming quite the hero around here. Great job!',70124),
(91758,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I can help ye\' track down this varmint. Let me whip somethin\' up for ye\'.',70124),
(91772,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'What\'s this, $n? Tracking kobolds?\r\n\r\nWell, of course they\'re headed toward the Fargodeep mine! That place is infested with kobolds.\r\n\r\nGood work, I guess. I\'m going to need someone to take care of that problem.',70124),
(92124,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Yah, I overheard. I warned Brother Paxton three times about the kobolds tunneling under the abbey.\r\n\r\nIt looks like the kobolds have taken a lot of books. There are whole bookshelves emptied out. You should probably see what Brother Paxton wants you to do about it.\r\n\r\nWhile you\'re here, can I talk to you about tradeskills? I\'d be happy to answer any questions you have, or point you toward the local trainers.',70124),
(92401,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'What I asked of you was not fair, nor would it have been unjust for you to simply walk away. Thank you stranger. I am unable to repay you in kind but I hope one of these is acceptable.\r\n\r\nI hope our paths cross again without such sorrow.',70124),
(92421,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Let those who fall from the Banshee Queen\'s grace meet our justice!\r\n\r\nWith these parts, our brothers and sisters have hope to see another day. You do Captain Bandarion proud.',70124),
(92422,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'While I have no doubt something of his kind will be replaced, we can only hope their ranks thin in the meantime.\r\n\r\nThank you $n.',70124),
(92460,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Gale\'s greetings, $n. I am honored to bestow your coming of age relic today as you are recognized for the potential you bring to the shen\'dorei. Our people have faced great hardship and persecution in our complex history.\r\n\r\nToday you are given this relic which is one of many held by those before you. Someday when your ashes are scattered to the winds it will pass to another to continue our tradition.\r\n\r\nAs you take this relic with you know that the winds of home will be with you wherever you travel.',70124),
(92461,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you for your service to Zephras, young $c.\r\n\r\nThe vuldren are typically quite docile, but the animals that call Zephras home can sense when the magic on the winds is out of balance, which can lead to dangerous and unpredictable behavior if left unchecked.',70124),
(92462,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Judging by the amount of bug entrails covering you, this must be quite the infestation.',70124),
(92463,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Excellent work, $n. You\'d make a fine ranger if this whole "adventurer" thing doesn\'t work out for you.',70124),
(92464,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Rorian sent you? Good. I could use your aid.',70124),
(92465,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It pains me to shed shen\'dorei blood here in the grove, but we do what we must.',70124),
(92468,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well done! Know this--totems ain\'t just a mark of yer place among shamans. They\'re tools, a focus for spells tied to stone, soil, and other elements. As ye grow wiser, more o\' the mountain\'s power will open to ye. The trainers will know when yer ready for more. But for now, take this totem, and let the ground speak through ye.',70124),
(92469,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'This is most troubling, but unfortunately unsurprising. We\'ve been aware of the cult\'s movements for some time, but we\'ve been content to watch from afar. Their agitation of the wind spirits near the standing stones is a clear escalation on their part.\r\n\r\nYou\'ve performed a difficult but necessary service for Thendal Grove, $n. Thank you.',70124),
(92470,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Very well done. You\'ve felled beasts and laid low cultist interlopers. You have shown great promise but your path must soon take you beyond the relative safety of Thendal Village.',70124),
(92471,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Rorian has told me much of you. I am likely unknown to you, but I am a member of the Council of Elders here on Zephras Isle. I\'ve come to read the flow of the winds here in Thendal Grove. I\'m also here to assess young shen\'dorei such as yourself that are coming of age.\r\n\r\nSo tell me, are you ready to take your next step? Are you ready to serve Zephras Isle?',70124),
(92472,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Aetheen sent you, then? I\'ll confess, you don\'t look like much to me, but Shen\'dar Village won\'t turn down willing aid, much less aid sent from Elder Aetheen herself.',70124),
(92473,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well done, $c. The Rangers of the Grove are in your debt.',70124),
(92474,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'How many times do I need to tell Myriaal not to encourage others to make reckless usage of our skyborne gifts!\r\n\r\nThat being said, I suppose that a little bit of practice in the relative safety of the village is... acceptable.\r\n\r\nIn the future I\'d simply suggest you to use your ability judiciously. You do not want to exhaust your magic thoughtlessly and then not be able to use it when you truly need it.',70124),
(92479,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Get yerself squared away, learn the lay o\' the land, and come back to me whenever you need training. I\'ll be here night or day.$B$BThis land is grown\' more dangerous, and as ye meet other folk, I think ye\'ll find they all have problems they could use some help with--help a skilled hunter can give \'em. Good luck.',70124),
(92482,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The way of the hunter is fraught with danger, and only those with the keenest senses and quickest reflexes can thrive in the wilds. I look at you and I am reminded of myself when I stood before my mentor, so many years ago. I believe that you have what it takes, but in the end that is up to you alone.\r\n\r\nSpeak with me again if you wish to take your next steps.',70124),
(92485,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The flora and fauna of Zephras Isle represent a rich tapestry of vibrant life. The ecosystem requires constant balance to maintain the harmony of nature, and we druids are the keepers of that balance. I see much potential in you, but this path is not an easy one, and you will need guidance as you grow in strength as a student of the fang, the claw, the feather, and the branch. \r\n\r\nSpeak with me again if you wish to take your next steps.',70124),
(92514,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Checked in with Rathiril then? Great. Lots of tension between the High Order and the Windshapers these days, but they keep things civil here in Shen\'dar. Well, at least in the village anyway. What happens out in the wilds stays in the wilds.\r\n\r\nNow that that\'s done, you look like someone who might be looking for something to do with their hands. I\'ve got a few things that need doing, if you are game for a bit of work?',70124),
(92515,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I didn\'t say it wouldn\'t be a dirty job, did I?',70124),
(92516,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well done, and quickly too. Not too bad at all.',70124),
(92517,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'With the bandits dispersed, that is one less problem for us to deal with. Though I confess that now I worry that any bandits who survived may turn next to the cult for protection, further bolstering their increasingly alarming numbers.\r\n\r\nStill though, we\'ll take the victories where we can get them.',70124),
(92528,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Lorthuna herself was there? She\'s the leader of the whole damned cult!\r\n\r\nIf they are making a move on Shen\'dar Village and the western watchtower, we\'ve got to be ready. What is strange is... why the watchtower?\r\n\r\nThe Village I can understand, but the tower? It doesn\'t have much strategic significance, other than as a minor lookout post.\r\n\r\nRegardless, we will be prepared for them. They\'ll find that highlanders aren\'t as easy to catch flat footed as they might think.',70124),
(92529,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'What is this? A new acolyte seeking to serve the windlord sent by sister Sania? Truly we are blessed by the touch of the four winds this day!\r\n\r\nWe welcome all who seek to bask in the blessings of Al\'Akir.',70124),
(92544,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It was all I could do to stop myself from going over and joining you from my position here. I can only hope that these louts got the message and clear out of here soon. \r\n\r\nThank you, $c. You have the gratitude of the Rangers of Thendal Grove.',70124),
(92550,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank the winds you\'ve returned!\r\n\r\nSania Silverstream snuck out of town just before you returned, no doubt fleeing at the sight of our people arming themselves.\r\n\r\nYou\'ve done an incredible thing for the people of Shen\'dar Village and we owe you a debt of gratitude. If the cult returns to the highlands, they will find that Shen\'dar is not such an easy target.\r\n\r\nWinds guide you, $n.',70124),
(92551,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'This is great! We\'ve been barely squeaking by without our regular supply deliveries. I\'ll work with the constable to ensure that these supplies get redistributed to the townsfolk who are in most dire need.',70124),
(92553,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'These eggs aren\'t easy to get but wind save me, they are DELICIOUS fried up in a bit of ursera tallow.\r\n\r\nIf you\'ve got a bit of time to spare and you enjoy cooking, I can teach you a few tips and tricks I\'ve picked up. Say the word and I\'d be happy to train you.',70124),
(92579,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Valennia\'s expression darkens as she reads the letter.>\r\n\r\nAonda trusted you to deliver this and she speaks highly enough of you in this letter, so I\'ll try to trust you too. Before we speak further, I need to consult with the few peacekeepers I have left here and formulate a plan in case the cult strikes here next. Enjoy your stay in Valanaar for now.\r\n\r\nIf you are looking to keep yourself busy, there are plenty of townsfolk that can likely use the help of a strong young adventurer like yourself.',70124),
(92595,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I think you now understand how important the mission of the Windshapers is. Every soul who commands the skysight is of vital importance if we hope to establish dialogue with the spirits of the winds once again.\r\n\r\nBetween threats from within such as the Al\'Aketh, and the uncertainty of our safety here in Skywall, it is our responsibility as Windshapers to use our gifts to save our home and ensure that the Shen\'dorei can survive these trying times.',70124),
(92597,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Do you feel it? Yes? Good! You have taken your first steps. You\'ll find that with your abilities, you will be able to tap into latent magical energy in many locations. Doing so will provide a myriad of benefits, some profound, others more subtle. You won\'t know until you tap into them, but that\'s the best part of the gift... making the unknown known.\r\n\r\nIf we are to survive these dire times, we must be unwavering in our search for knowledge... and power.',70124),
(92598,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Like a muscle, your skysight must be exercised if you hope to grow stronger in the gift. Leveraging your skysight to bridge the distance between the mortal and the spiritual may prove invaluable to you in your adventures.\r\n\r\nYou\'d do well to remember what you\'ve learned here today. Our ability to use our gifts to hear what the elements tell us could be the key to our survival.',70124),
(92640,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Tensions between the Windshapers and High Order are high right now, but we couldn\'t hope to carry out this plan without both groups on board.',70124),
(92642,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You are still alive? Thank the winds for small miracles, I suppose.',70124),
(92643,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<This man is clearly dead, killed by the assassins that you fought outside the house. As you kneel down to inspect the body you notice the glinting reflection of something shiny...>',70124),
(92644,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The turncoat was already dead when you arrived, you say? This is unfortunate news.\r\n\r\n<You hand over the crystal you found on the dead cultist\'s body.>\r\n\r\nInteresting...',70124),
(92645,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Belguilos is dead? Four winds bless you, $c. \r\n\r\nWe might just make it out of this alive after all.',70124),
(92646,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I sent a few of our remaining mages to ensure that Valennia and her forces were able to escape as well. She should be resting at High Elder Shadowsong\'s residence now.\r\n\r\nAnsirem had to return to Azeroth, but he and I discussed the next steps for the High Order before he departed. We survived the day, but Zephras is dangerously vulnerable now and we must make plans for what is to come.',70124),
(92679,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Aamelia listens while you explain what became of Alvarion.>\r\n\r\nAt least I know he\'s going to be safe in Valanaar.\r\n\r\nStranger, I hate to tell you this but I think my idiot husband likely just sent you here to die for nothing. If you have any sense at all, you should leave now. This isn\'t your fight.',70124),
(92682,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I watched you take down those bandits from the window. Not bad.',70124),
(92683,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'This stuff can be a bit messy and it tends to get everywhere. You\'ll probably be shaking this out of your trousers for weeks, unfortunately. I do appreciate it, though. I\'ve had this on my to-do list for weeks, but getting too far from the house when it\'s just me on my own with bandits lurking everywhere is a big risk.\r\n\r\nDon\'t bother asking me what I use this stuff for. Things. Stuff and things. Don\'t worry about it.',70124),
(92684,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'These are big tenderloins! You must have taken down some real monsters out there.',70124),
(92685,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'When I said the bloodier the better, you really listened. Good. It lets me know you made it hurt.\r\n\r\nOn a serious note, thank you for what you\'ve done so far. I\'ve been floating aimlessly around this farm for weeks as if I was just waiting for the end to come. I think I\'m starting to have hope again.\r\n\r\nFerauu and his thugs are due any time now. All that\'s left is to go out and face them. What do you say, will you see this through to the end with me?',70124),
(92693,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I... can\'t believe it\'s over. I need to stop and calm myself before my heart leaps right out of my chest.',70124),
(92698,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The construct? It\'s been wandering around the fields for decades. Since the wind elementals left us, I think. Alvarion suspected that it used to haul harvests to market, or maybe tend to livestock back before this was an orchard. That could have been a thousand years ago though.\r\n\r\nIn the old days, the Windshapers used to maintain these constructs. We\'ve talked about petitioning them to come and take a look at it, but it\'s never been a pressing concern to us. Mostly we just ignore it these days.',70124),
(92699,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Hello and welcome. Rathiril sent me a magical missive about you and he mentioned you had some promise.\r\n\r\nWith you standing before me now, I can see why he suggested you seek me out. You have a vibrant arcane aura about you. Few enough of us anymore have the aptitude, let alone the will, to do what is needed to save our home. Do you have the boldness and strength needed to aid the High Order?\r\n\r\nI suppose we will see.',70124),
(92700,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Elder Amberwind sent me a message about you and your exploits in Shen\'dar Village. You are most welcome here, friend.\r\n\r\nYou have a strong aura, and you clearly have a resonance with the spirits. Fewer and fewer of us have the skysight of late, and Zephras needs those with the gift if we are to survive these trying times. I am glad you have found your way to me.\r\n\r\nI look forward to further making your acquaintance.',70124),
(92703,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Alvarion\'s eyes tear up as you finish retelling the story of what happened at the orchard.>\r\n\r\nI don\'t know how to thank you, friend. I came to Valanaar looking for hope. A vain hope, I was almost certain. But instead I found a hero. A real hero, like the stories from before we came to Skywall. \r\n\r\nI\'ll never forget what you did for us, $n. You\'ll always be welcome at the Windfield home.',70124),
(92708,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'So do you now see? Rediscovering the ancient magic of our forebears is the key to unlocking the secrets of Zephras Isle and securing our future, but in order to save our home, we must rediscover what we\'ve lost these past millennia.\r\n\r\nAzeroth is the key. The Kirin Tor will show us the way.\r\n\r\nWhile we make ready to leave, you should check in with the other members of the High Order here in Valanaar. Most of them have tasks that they could use help from one such as yourself to see completed.',70124),
(92727,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you again, $n.',70124),
(92741,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'That is quite the haul of talons you\'ve brought me. I cannot wait to dig into this!\r\n\r\nThank you for your service to the High Order, $c.',70124),
(92834,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The High Order prides ourselves in our pragmatism and logic, and logic dictates that the avoidance of conflict and loss of life is the most prudent option in most situations.\r\n\r\n<Elaadrin\'s eyes begin to glow and crackle with arcane energy.>\r\n\r\n...however, the cult mistook our prudence for weakness and they are not nearly ready to pay the cost of that error.',70124),
(92840,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It would not have been my preference to spill Windshaper blood but the blame for this pointless conflict rests solely on their shoulders. We sought to peacefully gather information, and they responded with violence.\r\n\r\nUnfortunately, word has spread and the Windshapers are already calling it a \'massacre\'. They wouldn\'t dare to retaliate here in Valanaar, but they will certainly not forget.\r\n\r\n$n, you have been of tremendous aid to the High Order. Thank you.',70124),
(92871,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I am sorry to hear about Belathaan. He was actually my cousin and he was a good mage and servant of Zephras. We will avenge him.\r\n\r\nYou seem eager to lend aid immediately. Come, let\'s speak further on the current situation.',70124),
(92880,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Valennia looks visibly relieved as you tell her about the status of the eastern watchtower.>\r\n\r\nThank the winds.',70124),
(92881,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I have a small matter that requires just the kind of assistance that an adventurer like yourself can provide.',70124),
(92947,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'We fought hard to get this far but it isn\'t over yet.',70124),
(93036,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Greetings child, my name is Sania Silverstream and I am a junior priestess in the Order of the Al\'Aketh. Do you wish to learn more of our sovereign, the Windlord Al\'Akir?\r\n\r\nThere is always room at the Windlord\'s table for the righteous and the repentant.',70124),
(93065,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'We are as ready as we\'ll ever be.',70124),
(93090,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It gladdens me to hear that we have High Elder Shadowsong\'s blessing for our expedition. Now that the cult has been defeated and preparations have been made, I think it\'s finally time.\r\n\r\nAnsirem has worked diligently to help us get stable skycutter transport going between the city of Dalaran and Zephras Isle. We\'ve done as much testing as we can, and the time has come for our vanguard to depart.',70124),
(93159,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'...that\'s about all I have to say about it. I was--um--somewhere else before I was here. Now I\'m here and I have my friends, and my things. T-things I built, I mean. That\'s about all I need. I think that\'s all I need, anyway.\r\n\r\nI have to say though, it is nice to talk to someone who will talk back. The forest spirits try, but they just end up singing at me. That\'s nice in its own way, but not exactly s-stimulating conversation.',70124),
(93160,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you, stranger! You\'ll find that these are delicious once roasted! \r\n\r\nPlease excuse me, it won\'t take me long to whip this up.',70124),
(93165,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Excellent work. Only good things can happen by eliminating the cult. Hopefully this sends a message that the Nightclaw are not to be trifled with and that our resentments run deep.\r\n\r\nI suspect you have your work cut out for yourself, taking on the cult. If you gather more ears, bring them here.',70124),
(93172,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you, stranger.',70124),
(93317,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Winds bless me, this meat looks fantastic! \r\n\r\nThank you so much, $c.',70124),
(93318,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'If we didn\'t have enough on our plates between the cult and the highlands bandits, we don\'t need a giant vuldren terrorizing our citizens as well. You\'ve done a great thing here today. As promised, here is your reward.',70124),
(93319,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thanks $c. This should help us get by for now. If we can\'t get the supply routes squared away soon though, a few stolen windstones will be the least of our worries.',70124),
(93320,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'We are holding them off for now, but they have greater numbers and our fighters are starting to get tired. We need to do something to break the stalemate, and do it fast.',70124),
(93552,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you very much for these. As elves we all have a deep connection to magic and these windstones are becoming more and more precious as the magic imbued into this island by the great anchor pylons continues to fade. \r\n\r\nWindstones aren\'t the only beneficial thing you can harvest from the land. Please, take one of these manuals.',70124),
(93736,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Handling these essences fills me with a sense of... deep disquiet. I can almost feel a malevolent, regretful aura emanating from them. It\'s enough to make me faint.\r\n\r\n<Endaria shudders slightly.>\r\n\r\nI do not look forward to studying these further.',70124),
(93737,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Very interesting, so it was the High Order that was responsible for the construct breaking down?\r\n\r\nI know Belathaan. He\'s Valennia Stormfist\'s cousin and his mother was actually a Windshaper. It\'s disappointing that he was involved in this.\r\n\r\nI need to reflect on this for a moment.',70124),
(93740,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Ayessa looks shaken and distant as you hand her the windstone charms.>\r\n\r\nDon\'t mind me, $n. Today has merely been... a trying day. Thank you for your service to the windshapers thus far.',70124),
(93746,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Wait--what?! Belathaan... is dead? \r\n\r\n<Ayessa listens as you give your account of what occurred.> \r\n\r\nThe High Order was meeting with the Al\'Aketh to discuss peace? There is no peace with the cult, they are murderous zealots. What was Elaadrin thinking sending Belathaan to treat with them alone?\r\n\r\nPay this no mind, $n. You are not at fault for this. The arrogance of the High Order is to blame, yet again. You were merely in the right place at the wrong time.',70124),
(93836,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Talaanis Shadowsong listens intently as you tell him of what transpired above the Shrine of Akir, and of Elaadrin\'s plan to leave Zephras Isle.>\r\n\r\nI need to reflect on this further, but looking at the upside, we have rid ourselves of Lorthuna and deprived the cult of their leader. Our home has not been invaded yet, and on the timeline of elemental demigods, it could be years... decades even, before Al\'Akir deigns to turn his attention to us.\r\n\r\nThere is much to fear now, but much to celebrate as well.',70124),
(93926,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<The body here is somewhat fresh, clearly only recently having been killed. Judging by the burns and scorch marks on this peacekeeper\'s skin, it\'s clear that they were killed by the cult\'s storm-wielding spellcasters.>',70124),
(93927,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'So they are all dead, then. Storms curse these cult bastards!\r\n\r\nWhile you managed to take out the priest and stop the cultists at the tower, I confess that I\'m now doubly concerned about whatever it was you said that they were doing to the pylon. The fact that there was such a massive cache of windstones there with them tells me that they needed enormous energy for it.\r\n\r\nI have to wonder, what\'s the end goal here? Violating the pylon, attacking the village? To what end?',70124),
(93948,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I... am very sorry to hear that my nephew is dead. I thank you kindly for recovering this, and bringing it to me.\r\n\r\nIt\'s not common that such capable young shen\'dorei come down from the highlands. If you need work, please speak with Valennia Stormfist, the captain of the peacekeepers here in Valanaar. These days we need all the help we can get.',70124),
(93949,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I\'m sure there are more of these critters around Valanaar, but every enchanted skyhopper we stomp out makes the city just a tiny bit safer.',70124),
(93951,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It might seem a bit of a vain triviality, gathering feathers for our hair. However, even in times like these, one needs to embrace the small joys as much as possible. \r\n\r\nIf one thing I create brings someone joy, then I will consider that to be a good day. Thank you for bringing me these and helping me bring some joy to Zephras.',70124),
(93958,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Valennia looks gravely wounded.>',70124),
(94006,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'So, you wish to embrace the way of the claw, child? Very well. Let us speak.',70124),
(94411,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Direct conflict with our shen\'dorei brothers and sisters only weakens us as a people, but decisive action must at times be taken to prevent greater tragedy.\r\n\r\nThe mages of the High Order have zero regard for the consequences of their magical meddling. The forces that bind our island are fragile and vulnerable and all it could take is one thoughtless action to destroy our home.',70124),
(94413,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Sometimes I find it hard to distinguish between the blind zealotry of the Al\'Aketh cult, and the stubborn refusal of the Windshapers to change.\r\n\r\nIf they truly believed the winds would guide us, they should be sensing the direction the winds are blowing and flow with them rather than against them.',70124),
(94414,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you for taking a moment to share this with me. I will continue to watch over the grove, and ponder on the state of our homeland.',70124),
(94472,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Take this and remember, it is sacred.',70124),
(94484,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank goodness our message got to Lotheluum. Wait, where are the rest of the reinforcements? Surely it is not just you they sent?\r\n\r\n<Elegael pales as you relay your conversation with Lotheluum.>\r\n\r\nSo the message did not get through. We are in dire straits indeed then.\r\n\r\nIt seems we must handle this on our own. Time is of the essence.',70124),
(94485,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Elegael takes the sticky mound of moss from you with a weak smile.>\r\n\r\nThank you, $n, you have done well. This is exactly what we need.',70124),
(94486,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you for these. I will be sure to use every feather so their sacrifice will not be in vain.',70124),
(94487,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Elegael looks down at the collection of bloodied heirlooms with distress.>\r\n\r\nSo many young lives with so much potential now gone forever. Thank you for returning these, $c.\r\n\r\nI will hold onto them for safekeeping until I am able to take them to the High Elder. There they can go back into the collection and await the next and perhaps more worthy generation to come of age.',70124),
(94488,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Elegael grimaces at the severed head, but nods curtly.>\r\n\r\nThank you, $n. No matter how much rage I have within me, it would have been difficult to strike down my own cousin.\r\n\r\nDo not mourn for him. His ignorance and malice has killed many innocents this day.',70124),
(94489,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Elegael\'s face pales as you relay the fate of Jorel and the condition of the rest of the druids.>\r\n\r\nNo... no! This is far worse than I had--\r\n\r\n<Elegael chokes back a sob and grits her teeth, letting out a pained snarl.>\r\n\r\nThey will pay. They will ALL pay. Anyone who allies with the Al\'Aketh will feel my wrath! This I swear.',70124),
(94490,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'They were here for the pylon? But to what end? We were not the original reason for their attack?\r\n\r\n<Elegael trails off shaking with rage as she reads.>\r\n\r\nThey murdered my people because we were an inconvenience! I shall tear apart every cultist with my fangs! I will make sure none leave this place with their lives.\r\n\r\nGo, swiftly! If the orders truly originated in Valanaar, it means it is likely a traitor hiding there. Give the missive to Lotheluum in Valanaar and tell him what has transpired.',70124),
(94491,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Lotheluum wears a look of genuine terror as you recount the events from the druid den.>\r\n\r\nI--I\'m sorry, $n. I need just a moment. There are no words I possess that can describe the loss.\r\n\r\nThis is grave news indeed. If this missive is not fabricated, then we indeed have at best an accomplice and at worst a traitor here in Valanaar. I will take this to the High Elder immediately! I will not let my fellows\' sacrifice be in vain.',70124),
(94568,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'We could try and send peacekeepers to directly engage the cult forces, but we would not fare well against them in open battle.\r\n\r\nWe are going to need a different approach.',70124),
(94638,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The agony I feel over her loss is immeasurable, but it is what is necessary for the balance. You have demonstrated a resolve to persevere, even when a terrible price is asked.\r\n\r\nYou have done well, $c. I shall grant you the blessing to take on the shape of my kin. Be a beacon for those that lack the strength to persevere and a defender of those in need.\r\n\r\nGo now, and embrace the way of the claw, child.',70124),
(94793,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'A fledgling hunter, I see. Yes, I can bestow you with the skills you need to train and guide your pet. Not only will you be able to teach your pet new abilities, you will now be able to feed your pet, as well as revive it, should it fall in battle.$B$BRemember, $n, always respect the balance and live in awe of nature around you. Now, go forth. We shall speak again, at a later date.',70124),
(94864,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Excellent, $n! You are quite a fast learner. Now that you know the basics, I can teach you how to forge a lasting bond with an animal companion.\r\n\r\nGo with this knowledge and thrive. Be the hunter that Zephras Isle needs you to be.',70124),
(94896,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you, $c, you have done a great kindness to us refugees this day. I will make sure to return these to their owners. At least it gives us a place to start over from.',70124),
(94897,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Ealaane\'s eyes well with tears.>\r\n\r\nOh, Resaan my love. What will become of us now? There was so much... it feels as if our lives together had just started.\r\n\r\nThank you, $c. The world is cruel to take both my home and my love from me. At least his heirloom will give me some closure.',70124),
(94911,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'A high elf, speaking to me... in Thunder Bluff. Will wonders never cease?\r\n\r\nWell, shaper of wind, let me join our Earthen Ring brothers and sisters in welcoming you to Azeroth. My fellow druids of the Cenarion Circle have much wisdom to impart upon you, child of nature.',70124),
(94913,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ah I see that you have already mastered the form of the Bear. Good, good. You are well on your way, young druid.',70124),
(94946,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ah, you\'ve made it. Wonderful. It\'s going to take us some time to get ourselves established here, so you may want to take some time to explore the city. Be warned however, try not to venture too far from the safety of the city proper.  \r\n\r\nAs idyllic as this new land appears, it can be extremely dangerous to wander outside of Dalaran without appropriate preparation and experience.',70124),
(95204,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Oran bites the crest to ensure authenticity.>\r\n\r\nWell I\'ll be. A genuine relic of our home. Mostly intact, too. We need to be extra careful with this one.\r\n\r\nThank you for your aid in restoring our history, $c. I\'ll see to it that we take good care of this.',70124),
(95314,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You say there is evil in Shadowvale? I admit, I am not surprised. The forest folk were an odd lot, and they did not care for visitors. Some believe the Whispering Forest itself is cursed, and the elixir distilled from its roots carries that same curse...\r\n\r\n...but enough of superstition and rumors, $n. Thank you for the elixirs. Here, take this as payment.',70124),
(95349,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'More adventurers from Zephras, I see. Wonderful. The winds surely favor us! It\'s going to take us some time to get ourselves established here, so you may want to take some time to explore this new land.\r\n\r\nAzeroth is an exciting new world, but it\'s also a dangerous world. You\'d do well to prepare yourself for this new adventure by familiarizing yourself with the lands nearby.',70124),
(95350,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Lok-tar, $c. I am Thrall, Warchief of the Horde.\r\n\r\nAn Earthen Ring messenger told me to expect members of the Windshapers, and here you are. I\'d not have expected to see a high elf standing before me here in Orgrimmar, but the Horde will welcome you as our guest all the same.\r\n\r\nYou have my blessing to travel through Horde lands. Go with honor, Windshaper.',70124),
(95998,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'So now that we\'ve learned the basics, why don\'t you go and learn a tradeskill. They will also teach you the know-how to create a proper camp fixture suitable to your new profession.',70124),
(96339,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Wait, wait, you said your name was $n?\r\n\r\n$n! I am so glad to finally meet you. Someone delivered a package here addressed to you and assured me that you would eventually come to pick it up. I tried to tell them that we don\'t do that around here, but before I could get a word in, they were already gone!\r\n\r\nYour timing is great, too. It was gonna be lumped up with all the other garbage that I toss into the sea nightly.\r\n\r\nWhat? We all do it. Ugh, just take your package and go!',70124),
(96626,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'With this, you\'ll be able to set up a camp anywhere out in the wilderness. What you\'ve learned is just the basics, so you won\'t be able to place too many furnishings around it.\r\n\r\nRaise your cooking skill and you might just be able to learn to make even bigger fires.\r\n\r\nYou can also learn the basics of furnishing your campsites from other tradeskill trainers if you\'re savvy in their skills.',70124),
(96627,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I appreciate the lookin\' out, $c. That marshal\'s just a worrywart.\r\n\r\nHey, you\'ve got the look of an adventurer yourself. How would you like to learn about camping?',70124),
(97242,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'This type of cattail and speargrass is unique to Orgrimmar. Drinking from Azshara mountain spring water, and nourished by the sweat and blood soaked mineral dust of our rocky land, these herbs contain potent powers locked within.\r\n\r\nI\'ll give these to Yelmak, who may be able to win back Whuut\'s ear with a hands-on lesson.',70124),
(97246,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Of course. Migi\'s parents and I have an arrangement to give Migi a bagged lunch every day, but I can only ensure the boy gets his food if he actually comes in to pick it up.\r\n\r\nSometimes, he doesn\'t pick up his meal multiple times a week, and I wonder where he gets the energy to stay out and play.',70124),
(97249,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Borstan\'s Meats? Is that for one of us?\r\n\r\nOh!\r\n\r\nWow... this smells really good! Yummy.\r\n\r\nThanks for bringing me my lunch. I can tell what Borstan is going to be serving daily when my friends and I walk the road to Grommash Hold, by the smells alone. This tastes like my favorite, the sweetglaze! But it\'s different. I like the strong-flavored crumbs.\r\n\r\nIf it\'s going to be this tasty every day, I think we need to stop our game to take our lunch together!',70124),
(97277,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Aye, I\'m not surprised to hear that snow leopard was makin\' a meal of the boar we were fixin\' fer roastin\'!\r\n\r\nGoz will have one less thing to stress about now that you brought back his log book. Maybe now he can focus all his energy on gettin\' back on his feet.\r\n\r\nThanks, $n. Take a little something as a token of my appreciation, fer makin\' the trek, and fer protectin\' the hills.',70124),
(97291,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Excellent. We\'ll let his flesh simmer for awhile. Give him time to acclimate to his new home.\r\n\r\nI have no further use for the wretch for now, but we shall keep an eye on him. I have many plans for Othmar\'s future.',70124),
(97326,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'How can you even hold all of those boulders!\r\n\r\nThose are great. Most even have a nice flat side, too. Now that you carried them all the way over here we can scoot them around in the dirt, right where we want \'em.\r\n\r\nThanks, $n!',70124),
(97558,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ah, excellent! Thank you for acquiring these. I can promise they will be put to good use.',70124),
(97891,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ah, marvelous! I had been waiting for Alessandro\'s potion to arrive. The last six he sent destabilized along the way, but you\'ve made it just in time!\r\n\r\nHere, take this for your effort. That is all for now, unless you have other business with me?\r\n\r\nIf not, remove yourself so I may continue my experiments unhindered.',70124),
(97965,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'There you have it, you can now craft your very own First Aid Kit. Most folk don\'t care much for camps being set up in the center of town, so you\'ll need to head into the wilderness if you want to test it out.\r\n\r\nOh, and just remember, no camp is complete without a campfire. You\'ll need one of those before you start up your camp. Most cooks can teach you to make a fire. If you haven\'t already, you might want to check in with someone who can train you in the culinary arts to learn the basics.',70124),
(97967,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'There you have it, you can now craft your very own Fish Bowl. Most folk don\'t care much for camps being set up in the center of town, so you\'ll need to head into the wilderness if you want to test it out.\r\n\r\nOh, and just remember, no camp is complete without a campfire. You\'ll need one of those before you start up your camp. Most cooks can teach you to make a fire. If you haven\'t already, you might want to check in with someone who can train you in the culinary arts to learn the basics.',70124),
(97969,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'There you have it, your very own camp tent. Most folk don\'t care much for tents being set up in the center of town, so you\'ll need to head into the wilderness if you want to test it out.\r\n\r\nOh, and just remember, no camp is complete without a campfire. You\'ll need one of those before you start up your camp. Most cooks can teach you to make a fire. If you haven\'t already, you might want to check in with someone who can train you in the culinary arts to learn the basics.',70124),
(97971,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'There you have it, you can now craft your very own Camp Chair. Most folk don\'t care much for camps being set up in the center of town, so you\'ll need to head into the wilderness if you want to test it out.\r\n\r\nOh, and just remember, no camp is complete without a campfire. You\'ll need one of those before you start up your camp. Most cooks can teach you to make a fire. If you haven\'t already, you might want to check in with someone who can train you in the culinary arts to learn the basics.',70124),
(97972,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'There you have it, you can now craft your very own Rallying Banner. Most folk don\'t care much for camps being set up in the center of town, so you\'ll need to head into the wilderness if you want to test it out.\r\n\r\nOh, and just remember, no camp is complete without a campfire. You\'ll need one of those before you start up your camp. Most cooks can teach you to make a fire. If you haven\'t already, you might want to check in with someone who can train you in the culinary arts to learn the basics.',70124),
(98024,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'What\'s this? An elf? And you say the Warchief sent you?\r\n\r\n<Thork grunts sharply as he looks you up and down.>\r\n\r\nYou look a little skinny to me, but it matters not. Out here you\'ll either thrive and survive, or you\'ll die. That is the way of things in these lands.',70124),
(98322,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ol\' Whitebeard sent ya, aye?\r\n\r\nI got his report, alright. This whole situation\'s a mess!',70124),
(98389,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'May this help Executor Arren and so many others see our true nature. Much like in our past lives, we live to serve our people--to protect them with the gifts the Light provides us.\r\n\r\nThey will see in time that we are just as valuable to the Dark Lady\'s plans as any other.\r\n\r\nLight be with you.',70124),
(98512,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I\'m glad you made it back. That group of Al\'Aketh looked like stone cold killers. \r\n\r\nThank you for your aid, I\'ll include your assistance in my report when I return to Valanaar.',70124),
(98581,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The shamanic arts have been kept by the Wildhammer clan for years, an\' now those arts have passed into the care of the Bronzebeard dwarves as well. I\'m here ta help spread these teachings an\' offer guidance for new shamans learning the ways of the elements. Come ta me if ya need more trainin\' in the spells of earth, air, fire, an\' water.',70124),
(98601,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Your training can now begin in earnest, $c. I see great promise in you, but take care not to turn away from the light, even for a moment. Embrace the pain it will cause you. That pain is a crucible, and you will emerge from it stronger than you ever were in your previous life.',70124),
(99127,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'All the traps are like this? Seems our new neighboring nuisances are causing more destruction than we were aware of. I\'ll go broke if we don\'t do something about it.',70124),
(99134,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'There are precious few delights afforded to us in death. Thankfully, pain is chief among them.\r\n\r\nYou please me this day, and therefore you please the Dark Lady. Perhaps you can be of further use.',70124),
(99141,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I should have known better than to think an abomination could write anything of use. Let us keep that lapse of judgment between us.\r\n\r\nYou have pleased me, and therefore pleased the Dark Lady. Perhaps there is hope for you.',70124),
(99144,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Blessings upon you for aiding Dawnstone. Our order is still taking root here and it would be devastating to lose one so promising before his time.\r\n\r\nPlease accept this as a token of our thanks. Should you ever take an interest in our ways, our monastery Bandarion Keep lies on the bluffs northwest of the Solliden Farmstead. We welcome all who seek guidance in the Light.',70124),
(99260,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you for saving Fillion, $n. I\'m sure he told you how vital the data he was sent to retrieve is.\r\n\r\nWithout that data, our prospects for opening safe lanes of travel to Azeroth are in serious jeopardy. Our spies tell us that the Windshapers have themselves procured the means to traverse the planes, and no doubt wish to jealously guard this secret.\r\n\r\nAs ever, their own dogmatic hubris takes precedence over the good of our people. They are little better than the Al\'Aketh.',70124);
INSERT IGNORE INTO `quest_request_items` (`ID`,`EmoteOnComplete`,`EmoteOnIncomplete`,`EmoteOnCompleteDelay`,`EmoteOnIncompleteDelay`,`CompletionText`,`VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
(8,0,0,0,0,'Yes? Yes? What is it?$B$BThe forsaken; they certainly do have huge appetites. Make yourself at home... yes, rest those weary bones. My name\'s Renee if you need anything at all.',70124),
(18,0,0,0,0,'Have you gathered those bandanas for me yet?',70124),
(33,0,0,0,0,'Hey $n.  I\'m getting hungry...did you get that tough wolf meat?',70124),
(54,0,0,0,0,'You have word from McBride?  Northshire is a garden compared to Elwynn Forest, but I wonder what Marshal McBride has to report.$B$BHere, let me have his papers...',70124),
(179,0,0,0,0,'Wolves giving you a bit of trouble? You\'d do well to avoid the fangs and claws and other sharp bits, yes?',70124),
(182,0,0,0,0,'From what I\'ve learned, these trolls hail from the Frostmane clan. I\'m afraid I don\'t know much else about them that would be of any use to you, $n.',70124),
(218,0,0,0,0,'$n! Any luck?',70124),
(233,0,0,0,0,'Is there something I can help you with?',70124),
(282,0,0,0,0,'How are you? Like to share a drink with me, perhaps? Not much else to do in the cold.',70124),
(354,0,0,0,0,'Do you have the remains of the Agamands?  Are those cursed beasts finally destroyed?',70124),
(356,0,0,0,0,'Do you have a report of your patrol?',70124),
(358,0,0,0,0,'Is your task complete?  Have you destroyed those dog-things and drained them of their ichor?',70124),
(362,0,0,0,0,'Did you find Devlin?',70124),
(374,0,0,0,0,'Have you collected 10 Scarlet Insignia Rings yet, $c?',70124),
(375,0,0,0,0,'Do you have five Duskbat Pelts and some Coarse Thread yet, $n?',70124),
(376,0,0,0,0,'Do try your best to keep yourself unharmed until I get you some armor.',70124),
(381,0,0,0,0,'Those fools... They happily send themselves to their own graves.',70124),
(382,0,0,0,0,'How goes your mission, $n?',70124),
(383,0,0,0,0,'Yes, what do you want?',70124),
(384,0,0,0,0,'I\'m going to need six crag boar ribs and a mug of Rhapsody Malt, $n.',70124),
(398,0,0,0,0,'Yes?',70124),
(404,0,0,0,0,'Have you completed the task with which I have charged you?  Do you have those putrid claws?',70124),
(407,0,0,0,0,'Stay away, foul and unholy creature!  May the Light protect me!  The Scarlet Crusade shall rid Azeroth of your. . .$b$b. . .oh wait.  Is that food for me?  I am so hungry. . .',70124),
(426,0,0,0,0,'Our battles with the Scourge wage on, $n.  Do your part and throw those cursed, mindless undead back into the Plaguelands!',70124),
(492,0,0,0,0,'$n, were you able to obtain 5 Vile Fin Scales from the Murlocs?',70124),
(744,0,0,0,0,'This headdress will certainly be a wonderful gift for my brother.',70124),
(747,0,0,0,0,'Providing meat and feathers for the tribe is the first step in proving yourself as a hunter before the Chief.',70124),
(840,0,0,0,0,'What do you want, pup? If you\'re not here for recruitment, I don\'t have time for you.',70124),
(842,0,0,0,0,'Well well well, what do we have here? Has Kargal deemed me worthy of another recruit?',70124),
(1492,0,0,0,0,'You seek passage on the next ship, or have some item you wish to send aboard it?',70124),
(2160,0,0,0,0,'Hi there! Come in, take a seat by the fire and warm yourself with a flagon of ale.',70124),
(3092,0,0,0,0,'Welcome to Camp Narache, $n. I hear good things about you. Your bloodline is strong, and many of the elders consider you skilled already. But that we will test.$B$BThe plains of Mulgore will be your home for sometime--you should do your best to learn it very well. One day you will travel to unfamiliar lands to master greater skills. You must be ready.',70124),
(3100,0,0,0,0,'Ah, you got my letter, $n... good.$B$BThere\'s been an influx of warriors in Elwynn recently--which is good for Stormwind, but bad for the kobolds and Defias in the area.',70124),
(3361,0,0,0,0,'Oh goodness $n, this town is not well suited for the likes of me.  There are as many nasty creatures here as there were in Gnomeregan before the accident!$B$BDo you have my belongings?  If you don\'t, then who knows what the trolls have done with them now...',70124),
(3364,0,0,0,0,'Aye, I\'m Durnan Furcutter.  You have something for me?',70124),
(3365,0,0,0,0,'I trust the scalding mornbrew got to Durnan on time!  Did you remember to bring me back my mug?',70124),
(3902,0,0,0,0,'Have you managed to scavenge up some useful items for us?  There is no shame in reusing that which has been tossed aside.  No one is going to give us any handouts - we Forsaken will fend for ourselves!',70124),
(5481,0,0,0,0,'Where\'s that useless abomination? Either you have what I need or you\'d best get out there and find it.',70124),
(5723,0,0,0,0,'How goes your search for the Chasm? And the troggs?$B$BThe threat cannot be allowed to persist--it will only injure our orc brethren if it continues.',70124),
(5761,0,0,0,0,'Have you killed the beast? He surely must be the leader of the Searing Blade in Ragefire Chasm.',70124),
(6395,0,0,0,0,'We must respect our dead, $n.  It is one of the ways in which we differ from the Scourge...',70124),
(79097,0,0,0,0,'Have you brought something to add to our collection?',70124),
(86784,0,0,0,0,'Welcome to my fire, traveler.',70124),
(91741,0,0,0,0,'What\'s that you got there? It looks like one of my books.',70124),
(91743,0,0,0,0,'Have you rescued my books yet, $n?!',70124),
(91752,0,0,0,0,'Have you retrieved those stolen books yet?',70124),
(91772,0,0,0,0,'Have you figured out where the Kobolds are heading?',70124),
(92421,0,0,0,0,'What remains of the invading scourge? Have you managed to find suitable replacement parts?',70124),
(92461,0,0,0,0,'As unsavory as it is to need to cull living creatures, this type of guiding hand is needed to avert disaster in our homeland. This is an important lesson for one such as yourself to learn.',70124),
(92462,0,0,0,0,'Such pests cannot be allowed to find root in our peaceful grove. An infestation can quickly grow dangerous if left unchecked.',70124),
(92465,0,0,0,0,'Is it done?',70124),
(92468,0,0,0,0,'Ahh, ye\'ve returned. If ye have the stone, it means the mountain\'s chosen ye true. I\'ll give ye the totem it promised. But if ye\'ve come empty-handed, off with ye! The path ain\'t for those who forget their way.',70124),
(92470,0,0,0,0,'What I ask of you is not easy, but you must be prepared for much greater challenges if you are to survive long enough to be of service to Zephras Isle.',70124),
(92473,0,0,0,0,'The ursera have grown far more aggressive of late. I wonder what has changed to cause this shift in behavior?',70124),
(92479,0,0,0,0,'Ah, ye got me letter, $n... good.$B$BTime was when ye\'d not catch a human dead wit\' a bow in their hand--no more, I guess. It\'s good for Stormwind, but bad for the kobolds and man eatin\' beasts in the area.',70124),
(92482,0,0,0,0,'<Tai\'ree nods at you curtly.>',70124),
(92485,0,0,0,0,'Greetings, I am Xyton Silverwind, keeper of druidic lore.',70124),
(92515,0,0,0,0,'If you ask me, I think Prideclaws are actually kind of cute. From a safe distance... and while standing behind someone holding a sword, of course.',70124),
(92550,0,0,0,0,'It feels good to turn the tables on these zealots.',70124),
(92551,0,0,0,0,'There\'s a lot of hungry and desperate skyborne here who need these supplies.',70124),
(92553,0,0,0,0,'No matter how much things change here on Zephras and how uncertain things get, I always say that a pipe full of dried peacebloom and nice full belly is a comfort that can\'t be beat!',70124),
(92579,0,0,0,0,'A letter from Aonda. What\'s that crafty highlander been up to?',70124),
(92644,0,0,0,0,'You are back? And... alone?',70124),
(92679,0,0,0,0,'What? Alvarion is alive?',70124),
(92682,0,0,0,0,'These bandits are more likely to double cross and steal from each other than they are to steal from normal folks. I bet if Ferauu knew some of his people went rogue and came here early to tamper with the harvest, he\'d kill them himself.',70124),
(92683,0,0,0,0,'Flutterflies are normally docile and calm, but rub them the wrong way and sometimes they\'ll surprise you.',70124),
(92684,0,0,0,0,'I don\'t think I\'ve had real meat for dinner in... well, too long.',70124),
(92685,0,0,0,0,'If you manage to bring me enough bandit masks, maybe I\'ll stitch a blanket out of them and give it to Ferauu.\r\n\r\n<Aamelia laughs loudly.>',70124),
(92693,0,0,0,0,'There\'s not enough stormapples in skywall to repay you for this.',70124),
(92727,0,0,0,0,'Those shrieklings are too dangerous to be left to nest this close to Valanaar. However... they are the least of our troubles.',70124),
(92741,0,0,0,0,'The High Order do not make it a habit to employ themselves as simple trappers and game wardens, but when performing a service such as this can lead to scholarly gain, we are happy to engage in acts of community service.',70124),
(92834,0,0,0,0,'I don\'t agree with the Windshapers often, but they were right to dismiss the idea of trying to engage peacefully with the Al\'Aketh. My attempt to take the high road cost a dear friend his life and is a mistake I will have to live with for the rest of my days.',70124),
(92840,0,0,0,0,'It\'s often difficult for me to establish a distinction between the Windshapers and the Al\'Aketh, save that one is more overtly violent than the other. Equally slavish to their misplaced beliefs, they are both equally dangerous if left to their own devices.\r\n\r\nThey see our desire to better understand this realm and its magic as a desecration of their traditions. Their small-mindedness is why our mission is so important. If not us, who will have the courage to save Zephras?',70124),
(93160,0,0,0,0,'Mmm, I think you are going to like what I can cook up with these acorns!',70124),
(93165,0,0,0,0,'I will not rest until my fangs have gone through the throat of every single cultist on this isle.',70124),
(93317,0,0,0,0,'Windsong Crawler meat is common enough here but it was something of a delicacy on the islands of Anvilas and Siroccas. Was a time, back when the skystreams were open that the locals would mob me for the stuff when I\'d make the trip to Shen\'dramar or New Eldre\'naar.\r\n\r\nNot been able to visit those places in... well... a long time.',70124),
(93318,0,0,0,0,'I\'ll need the creature\'s head as proof of the deed.',70124),
(93319,0,0,0,0,'These sneakthieves have likely been breaking into our supplies for months. I tried to convince Aonda to put a raid together to clear out that bandit cave for good, but she didn\'t want to pull the few peacekeepers we have away from the village. \r\n\r\nWith the cultists at Falaath Village to the south growing in numbers, I suppose I can\'t fault her for that.',70124),
(93459,0,0,0,0,'<Vayn nods at you.>',70124),
(93552,0,0,0,0,'Hello there, $c.',70124),
(93736,0,0,0,0,'Shadowgale Forest is a dangerous place. Some even say it\'s haunted. I\'m quite sure that I don\'t believe that, but I do know that it\'s not for the faint hearted, or the unprepared.',70124),
(93737,0,0,0,0,'I can\'t imagine why anyone would want to steal these components from this construct. Other than the gyrozephyr these components have almost no practical application. Even the gyro would be nigh-useless outside of its intended purpose.',70124),
(93740,0,0,0,0,'The Al\'Aketh have engaged in their bloody zealotry for far too long. This is only the start of the reckoning they face.',70124),
(93927,0,0,0,0,'What news from the western watch?',70124),
(93948,0,0,0,0,'What is that you have for me? Oh... oh no.',70124),
(93951,0,0,0,0,'What beautiful things did you bring me?',70124),
(94414,0,0,0,0,'My gift is simple, and mundane. I cannot peer between worlds such as those with the skysight, nor can I draw upon the magic of the ley lines beneath Zephras like others can. But a gift it remains and I am grateful to have it.\r\n\r\nAppreciation of what you have is the key to happiness. Yearning for what you may have, or what you have lost, only leads to despair.',70124),
(94485,0,0,0,0,'Have you found the Lady\'s Tear?',70124),
(94486,0,0,0,0,'It deeply saddens me to ask you to kill the young shrieklings, but with the rise in their aggression it is for the best. We can only handle so many emergencies at a time.',70124),
(94487,0,0,0,0,'I will make the cult pay for every drop of druid blood they have spilled this day.',70124),
(94488,0,0,0,0,'Are our brethren\'s lives truly worth so little to you, Haalien?',70124),
(94864,0,0,0,0,'You will learn, $n, and one day you will be a great hunter.',70124),
(94896,0,0,0,0,'So many of us left with nothing more than the clothes on our backs. Any belongings you might recover would be cherished.',70124),
(94897,0,0,0,0,'Have you any news of Resaan? Please, $c, the wait is hard to endure after everything that has happened.',70124),
(95204,0,0,0,0,'What have you got there, $c? A tasty morsel?',70124),
(95314,0,0,0,0,'I trust you did not get lost?',70124),
(95998,0,0,0,0,'Having the skills needed to survive the outdoors is critical. A well-rested and well-prepared adventurer has a much higher chance of surviving this lifestyle.',70124),
(96627,0,0,0,0,'Are you here to learn about camping in the wilderness?',70124),
(97242,0,0,0,0,'We discover formulations and recipes by showing old ingredients to new generations, who experiment with them in their own way.',70124),
(97249,0,0,0,0,'I think we can win this one...',70124),
(97277,0,0,0,0,'Poor Goz is more concerned for his mecha-walker than himself. Says if anyone gets a hold of that mechanic\'s log he\'s greased. Hah! That\'s why I told him he should just leave his work at home!',70124),
(97291,0,0,0,0,'For Othmar\'s crimes against the Dark Lady, placing him under that oozing specimen is the least he deserves.\r\n\r\nAnd it\'s funny...',70124),
(97326,0,0,0,0,'It\'s nice to not have to always sit in the dirt!',70124),
(97485,0,0,0,0,'There are many occasions one may choose to spread incense to the winds. You could be asking the Earthmother to watch over someone, bless a hunt, celebrate an occasion, or even to seek guidance from our ancestors.\r\n\r\nOr it could be something else entirely.\r\n\r\nThough the act is done with reverence, it is not strictly a ceremonial affair. Typically there are certain traditional steps observed when performing this act, but many tribes have differing practices.',70124),
(97558,0,0,0,0,'Have you gathered the skin I inquired about? Our stocks are running low.\r\n\r\nIt may seem odd to ask for murloc skin but it works well for internal membranes, or surfaces like cheeks or mouths.\r\n\r\nSimilarly, the duskbat wing membranes are especially suited for more delicate areas, like faces or fingers. It prevents the skin from being too... thick.',70124),
(97968,0,0,0,0,'Yes, I can teach you.',70124),
(97969,0,0,0,0,'Yes, I can teach you.',70124),
(97971,0,0,0,0,'Yes, $c. I can teach you.',70124),
(98581,0,0,0,0,'Ah, you were able to read the rune? It is imbued with the power of elements from some of our oldest script. That shows that you have the makings of a shaman.',70124),
(98601,0,0,0,0,'Through pain comes resolve.',70124),
(99127,0,0,0,0,'Any catches to speak of?',70124),
(99141,0,0,0,0,'You\'d best have those reports in hand, or get out of my face.',70124),
(99196,0,0,0,0,'We are currently accepting donations for wool cloth.  A donation of sixty pieces of wool cloth will net you full recognition by Orgrimmar for your generous actions.  Our stores are such on wool that we would only need sixty pieces from you total; we should be able to acquire enough from others in the realm to support our drive.$B$BIf you have the sixty pieces of wool cloth on you and are ready to donate them, I\'m able to take them from you now.',70124);
INSERT INTO `creature_text` (`CreatureID`,`GroupID`,`ID`,`Text`,`Type`,`Language`,`Probability`,`Emote`,`Duration`,`Sound`,`SoundPlayType`,`BroadcastTextId`,`TextRange`,`comment`) VALUES
(250282,0,0,'%s attempts to run away in fear!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Vile Fin Seer (sniff)'),
(250283,0,0,'%s attempts to run away in fear!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Vile Fin Attacker (sniff)'),
(250656,0,0,'%s becomes enraged!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Fallen Berserker (sniff)'),
(250657,0,0,'Such errant and unfortunate souls...',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Rath\'mael (sniff)'),
(250657,1,0,'Even in death... I will persist.',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Rath\'mael (sniff)'),
(250660,0,0,'Fresh meat for the block!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The Baron (sniff)'),
(250660,1,0,'Forgive me, Lordaeron...',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The Baron (sniff)'),
(250874,0,0,'%s becomes enraged!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Vuldren Alpha (sniff)'),
(250921,0,0,'The tiny sprite squeaks fearfully and vanishes!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Forest Sprite (sniff)'),
(250929,0,0,'THREAT DETECTED. ADMINISTERING VIOLENCE.',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Malfunctioning Cyclone Construct (sniff)'),
(250929,1,0,'FUNCTION FULFILLED. RESUMING REST MODE.',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Malfunctioning Cyclone Construct (sniff)'),
(251451,0,0,'Die, non-believer!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Al\'Aketh Ambusher (sniff)'),
(251451,1,0,'%s attempts to run away in fear!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Al\'Aketh Ambusher (sniff)'),
(251451,2,0,'Submit to the will of the windlord and beg his forgiveness!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Al\'Aketh Ambusher (sniff)'),
(251918,0,0,'%s attempts to run away in fear!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Highlands Bandit (sniff)'),
(251966,0,0,'Only the righteous will be saved from what is to come! Death to non-believers!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Commander Cyclas (sniff)'),
(252068,0,0,'%s attempts to run away in fear!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Al\'Aketh Stormcaller (sniff)'),
(252481,0,0,'The tiny sprite squeaks fearfully and vanishes!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Wind Sprite (sniff)'),
(252664,0,0,'%s attempts to run away in fear!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Al\'Aketh Stormchaser (sniff)'),
(252666,0,0,'Prepare to be BROKEN, non-believer!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Commander Belguilos (sniff)'),
(252763,0,0,'%s attempts to run away in fear!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Al\'Aketh Spiritcaller (sniff)'),
(252764,0,0,'%s attempts to run away in fear!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Al\'Aketh Skypriest (sniff)'),
(252800,0,0,'It\'s time, stranger. One way or another, let\'s finish this.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Aamelia Windfield (sniff)'),
(252802,0,0,'%s attempts to run away in fear!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Hungry Bandit (sniff)'),
(252820,0,0,'%s attempts to run away in fear!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Bandit Highwayman (sniff)'),
(252863,0,0,'Little apple farmers! Ferauu is here to collect what is owed!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ferauu the Bludgeon (sniff)'),
(253195,0,0,'%s attempts to run away in fear!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Al\'Aketh Preacher (sniff)'),
(253511,0,0,'%s attempts to run away in fear!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Al\'Aketh Pillager (sniff)'),
(253622,0,0,'You are too late. The ritual is complete!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Commander Haalien (sniff)'),
(253782,0,0,'%s attempts to run away in fear!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Al\'Aketh Attacker (sniff)'),
(253847,0,0,'We were hoping for more reinforcements, but this will have to do. Let\'s push forward!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Elaadrin Evengale (sniff)'),
(254588,0,0,'%s attempts to run away in fear!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Windsong Crawler (sniff)'),
(254596,0,0,'%s attempts to run away in fear!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Al\'Aketh Healer (sniff)'),
(255534,0,0,'%s attempts to run away in fear!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'"Badwind" Bennic (sniff)'),
(256306,0,0,'The skycutter to Zephras Isle has just arrived. Please watch your step when boarding the vessel.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Arcanist Laurain (sniff)'),
(256306,1,0,'The ride can sometimes be bumpy and it is recommended that you hold onto something firmly when traveling between planes of existence.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Arcanist Laurain (sniff)'),
(256966,0,0,'The grand design of the High Priestess is in motion! There is nothing you can do to stop it!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Skypriest Aanders (sniff)'),
(256966,1,0,'You cannot stop Lorthuna\'s great work! The windlord\'s will has been done!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Skypriest Aanders (sniff)'),
(257521,0,0,'We are the descendants of the Highborne and we will not be denied!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'High Order Apprentice (sniff)'),
(257521,1,0,'Why...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'High Order Apprentice (sniff)'),
(257521,2,0,'You will not stand in the way of progress!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'High Order Apprentice (sniff)'),
(257521,3,0,'You would doom us all...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'High Order Apprentice (sniff)'),
(257521,4,0,'Your stubborness will doom Zephras!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'High Order Apprentice (sniff)'),
(257521,5,0,'For the High Order!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'High Order Apprentice (sniff)'),
(257521,6,0,'Supreme Magister... I have... failed.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'High Order Apprentice (sniff)'),
(257532,0,0,'Your recklessness will doom us all!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Windshaper Novice Seer (sniff)'),
(257532,1,0,'Spirits of the wind... forgive me...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Windshaper Novice Seer (sniff)'),
(257532,2,0,'Only the Windshapers can save Zephras Isle!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Windshaper Novice Seer (sniff)'),
(257532,3,0,'Doomed... we are... doomed...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Windshaper Novice Seer (sniff)'),
(257532,4,0,'I have... failed...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Windshaper Novice Seer (sniff)'),
(257532,5,0,'Be gone from this place!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Windshaper Novice Seer (sniff)'),
(257532,6,0,'The meddling of your order will hasten our doom!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Windshaper Novice Seer (sniff)'),
(257532,7,0,'Death to the High Order desecrators!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Windshaper Novice Seer (sniff)'),
(257532,8,0,'You hasten our... destruction...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Windshaper Novice Seer (sniff)'),
(257532,9,0,'The arcane is an affront to the wind spirits!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Windshaper Novice Seer (sniff)'),
(259377,0,0,'I need no help from the light. Begone, paladin.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Injured Deathguard (sniff)'),
(259377,1,0,'I... thank you, paladin.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Injured Deathguard (sniff)'),
(259433,0,0,'I will not accept this! I serve the light!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Tarnished Zealot (sniff)'),
(259433,1,0,'The light will purify us both!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Tarnished Zealot (sniff)'),
(259434,0,0,'The light will purify us both!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Tarnished Drudge (sniff)'),
(259434,1,0,'Burn in righteous flame, vile monster!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Tarnished Drudge (sniff)'),
(265701,0,0,'Engoth Nagan waldir! Far Gothalgos!',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Captain Truman (sniff)'),
(270201,0,0,'%s attempts to run away in fear!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Al\'Aketh Brawler (sniff)'),
(271613,0,0,'UUUUUuuuuurrrgh!!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Unfinished Abomination (sniff)'),
(271968,0,0,'I was in over my head!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Forsaken Adventurer (sniff)'),
(271968,1,0,'It had to be spiders...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Forsaken Adventurer (sniff)'),
(271968,2,0,'Has anyone seen my weapon?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Forsaken Adventurer (sniff)'),
(271968,3,0,'Thank you. I\'ll head back to Deathknell.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Forsaken Adventurer (sniff)'),
(272101,0,0,'I will double up my efforts.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Deathguard Lizabetha (sniff)'),
(275269,0,0,'The skycutter bound for Dalaran City has just arrived. All aboard for Dalaran City!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'High Order Dockmaster (sniff)'),
(275270,0,0,'The Skycutter bound for Mulgore has arrived! All aboard for Mulgore!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Windshapers Dockmaster (sniff)'),
(275954,0,0,'The heretics were to try me for my crimes--of existing at all, I suppose.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Bareth Dawnstone (sniff)'),
(275954,1,0,'I believe I\'ve overstayed my welcome. Let\'s get out of here.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Bareth Dawnstone (sniff)'),
(275954,2,0,'Follow that path up into Bandarion Keep, if you wish. Others like myself are stationed there.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Bareth Dawnstone (sniff)'),
(275954,3,0,'Brill is this way. Let\'s keep moving.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Bareth Dawnstone (sniff)'),
(275954,4,0,'I can make it the rest of the way on my own. Let Shari Stilwell know I\'m safe. I have one small matter to attend to first.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Bareth Dawnstone (sniff)');
